This product includes software developed as part of the Rebol 3 project.

Both sets of borrowed files come from Oldes/Rebol3
(https://github.com/Oldes/Rebol3), which is itself a continuation of
REBOL, Copyright 2012 REBOL Technologies. Copyright 2012-2026 Rebol Open
Source Contributors. Both are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, and each file carries its own copyright and licence header.

The complete Oldes/Rebol3 source tree is vendored under `rebol3-source/`,
with its own LICENSE and NOTICE, so the C and Rebol library can be read,
searched and built without a network or a separate checkout. It is reference
source: it is not compiled into JEBOL and does not ship in the jar or the
distribution archive.

The files under src/main/resources/org/jebol/mezz/ are copies of Rebol's
own library, taken from src/mezz/ upstream. A few are modified, and
src/main/resources/org/jebol/mezz/ORDER.txt names each one, what was changed
and why. Every other file is unmodified. They are loaded
and evaluated at startup, and they are the part of the borrowed code that
ships: they are inside the jar under org/jebol/mezz/, and thus inside the
distribution archive. They are the larger part of that jar.

src/main/resources/org/jebol/modules/r3-gui.reb is the R3 GUI, version
0.2.1, by REBOL Technologies: the body of http://www.rebol.com/r3/gui.r, the
file Rebol's LOAD-GUI fetched in 2010. Neither the file nor its documentation
at https://www.rebol.com/r3/docs/gui/gui.html states a licence; JEBOL treats
it as licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as Rebol's own source
is. It is modified so that it runs on Rebol 3.22, and ORDER.txt lists each
edit. It ships inside the jar.

The files under src/testFixtures/resources/rebol-suite/ are unmodified test
scripts, taken from src/tests/ upstream. They do not ship.

They are vendored rather than fetched so the suite is reproducible
without a network, and the test scripts are kept byte-for-byte as
published so that a failure is unambiguously ours.

REBOL is a trademark of REBOL Technologies. JEBOL is not associated with
or endorsed by REBOL Technologies or by the maintainers of Oldes/Rebol3.

